---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-84-food-systems-local-provisioning-community-resource-security-registry.json";

const production = registry.food_production_land_water_sovereignty_dossiers;
const provisioning = registry.processing_storage_distribution_local_provisioning_ledgers;
const access = registry.food_access_affordability_nutrition_institutional_meals_registers;
const security = registry.reserve_contamination_circularity_community_resource_security_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Food Systems And Community Resource Security | FTFN" description="Thirty-two inactive food-production, provisioning, access, nutrition, reserve, and community-resource-security records.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-food-systems-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Food Systems</div><h1 class="page-title">Food availability is not nutritional access, and inventory is not a usable reserve.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 84 traces whether communities can sustain lawful and ecologically viable production, protected land and water, Indigenous food sovereignty, usable processing and storage, fair local procurement, accessible nutrition, safe institutional meals, emergency reserves, contamination control, circular flows, and long-horizon material security.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive production dossiers" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive provisioning ledgers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive access registers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive security ledgers" /><MetaPill label="0 food-system decisions" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Production, Land, Water And Sovereignty</div><h2>Eight production dossiers remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/food-systems-doctrine-001/">Read the food-systems doctrine</a></div><div class="grid">{production.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.production_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/food-systems/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Production systems, land tenure, Indigenous rights, soil, water, energy, seed, biodiversity, climate, workforce, ownership, finance, yield, loss, distribution, adaptation, review, and receipts remain empty.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Processing, Storage, Distribution And Local Provisioning</div><h2>Eight provisioning ledgers contain no capacity finding.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/processing-storage-cold-chain-001/">Read the processing and storage guide</a></div><div class="grid">{provisioning.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.provisioning_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/food-systems/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.processing_storage_distribution_local_provisioning_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Facilities, storage, cold chain, preservation, logistics, markets, procurement, community benefit, workforce, utilities, inventory, contracts, surge, and fallback remain unassessed.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Access, Affordability, Nutrition And Institutional Meals</div><h2>Eight food-access registers remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/food-affordability-nutrition-dignity-001/">Read the access and dignity guide</a></div><div class="source-list">{access.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/food-systems/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.food_access_affordability_nutrition_institutional_meals_register_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Food need, availability, prices, benefits, nutrition, dietary fit, disability and language access, dignity, school and institutional meals, kitchens, gardens, eligibility, queues, cooking capacity, health, burden, and remedy remain unassessed.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.access_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Reserves, Contamination, Circularity And Resource Security</div><h2>Eight community-resource-security ledgers contain no release or finding.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/emergency-reserves-community-kitchens-001/">Read the reserve guide</a></div><div class="grid">{security.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/food-systems/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.reserve_contamination_circularity_community_resource_security_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Reserve condition and release, cold chain, contamination, testing, traceability, recall, waste prevention, redistribution, compost, repair, rationing, ecosystem recovery, adaptation, normalization, learning, and audit remain inactive.</p><MetaPill label={record.security_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty community food-security state.</h2><p>The export publishes the complete control surface without allocating land, water, food, benefits, contracts, inventory, or reserves; issuing a nutrition finding, recall, rationing order, or remedy; or creating a receipt, score, rank, or stage change.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/food-systems-local-provisioning-community-resource-security.json">Food systems JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
